                    "kind": "retry",
                    "rate": 2.2
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "short": "Retry + DLQ",
              "chapter": "solution",
              "title": "Back off, then park the poison",
              "body": [
                "Failed jobs are retried with <span class=\"term\">exponential backoff</span> — 10 s, 1 min, 5 min. Most real failures (a storage blip) pass on retry.",
                "After 3 attempts the job moves to a <span class=\"term\">dead-letter queue</span>, so it stops blocking everyone else. An alert fires and a human looks at it."
              ],
              "callout": {
                "kind": "insight",
                "text": "Retries handle transient errors; the dead-letter queue handles permanent ones. You need both."
              },
              "changes": [
                "+ Max 3 attempts with backoff",
                "+ Dead-letter queue + alert",
                "~ Backlog 12k → 0 in 6 min"
              ],
              "metrics": {
                "p99": 1400,
                "ok": 99,
                "cpu": 24,
                "lag": {
                  "value": "~4 s",
                  "level": "good"
                }
              },
