            {
              "short": "Trade-off",
              "chapter": "tradeoff",
              "title": "Thumbnails arrive a moment later",
              "body": [
                "Because resizing is asynchronous, a photo is visible a few seconds before its thumbnails exist. The feed shows a blurred placeholder (generated on the phone) until the photo is <code>ready</code>.",
                "We accepted this: a 4-second placeholder is far better than a 9-second upload spinner."
              ],
              "callout": {
                "kind": "decision",
                "text": "Chosen: async + placeholder. Rejected: resizing inside the upload request (slower uploads, API back on the hot path)."
              },
              "changes": [
                "+ Client-side blur placeholder",
                "~ Feed polls status until ready"
              ],
